# Claude Code files are local-only, never committed (owner rule)
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
claude-*/
memory/
*claude*prompt*
ORDER-SESSION-PROMPT.md

# Python
.venv/
*.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# FreeCAD
*.FCBak
*.FCStd1

# KiCad working state (route sessions, logs, per-user prefs, backups)
out/
logs/
*.kicad_prl
*-backups/
fp-info-cache
_autosave-*
~*.kicad_*
*.lck
*.dsn
*.ses

# OS noise
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Agent instruction files are local-only, never committed (the same rule as CLAUDE.md): the launcher of
# v2/docs/CODEX-WORKER.md writes one into a job's worktree and removes it after the job
AGENTS.md
# Makers' IBIS models (stream w5si, SI-001): held locally and fetched by their manifest, never committed,
# because several of their headers forbid redistribution (owner decision pending; v2/docs/EXECUTION-PLAN.md).
v2/vendor/*/ibis/*.ibs
# Makers' documents held back from the public tree by their terms (stream a1solar, 29 September 2026): fetched by
# v2/docs/records/a1solar/fetch_held_back.py and checked by sha256, never committed.
v2/vendor/solar/held/
# TI's datasheets of the charger FETs chosen by stream s117 (29 September 2026), held back by their IMPORTANT NOTICE:
# fetched by v2/docs/records/s117/fetch_held_back.py and checked by sha256, never committed.
v2/vendor/ti/held/
v2/vendor/nexperia/held/
# PANJIT's SS2020FL series sheet (board C's D19 to D21), held back by its terms from integration set 15 (29 September
# 2026; its page 4: "Reproducing and modifying information of the document is prohibited without permission"):
# fetched by v2/docs/records/int16/fetch_held_back.py and checked by sha256, never committed.
v2/vendor/power/held/
# The write-path marker of v2/docs/records/s117/apply_gen_sch_a_s117.py (and its FET sibling): never committed.
v2/docs/records/s117/*.applied
